1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:07,402
Welcome to AgentPay, the autonomous commerce assistant for the PayPal AI Hackathon 2026.

2
00:00:07,352 --> 00:00:14,443
Online shopping forces buyers to compare specs, search for expired coupons, and worry about seller legitimacy.

3
00:00:14,443 --> 00:00:18,989
AgentPay turns commerce into an autonomous workflow powered by PayPal.

4
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:32,344
On the AgentPay workspace, we initiate our procurement goal: 'Find a portable monitor under $150 with 4K resolution, check reviews, negotiate deals, and checkout.

5
00:00:32,294 --> 00:00:36,817
We lock our budget cap at $150 and launch the reasoning loop.

6
00:00:38,936 --> 00:00:41,818
Watch the live Decision Ledger on the left.

7
00:00:41,768 --> 00:00:49,064
The agent scans verified merchant inventory, securing an exclusive $50 rebate with code AGENTDEAL25.

8
00:00:49,064 --> 00:00:54,916
Next, it verifies a 98% trust rating and a guaranteed 30-day return policy.

9
00:00:57,027 --> 00:01:01,931
On the right, AgentPay presents the matched KYY 4K OLED Monitor.

10
00:01:01,881 --> 00:01:13,131
The ledger proves complete pricing transparency: list price is reduced by our $50 rebate to $148.39, strictly respecting our $150 budget limit.

11
00:01:15,261 --> 00:01:17,018
Now we checkout.

12
00:01:16,968 --> 00:01:21,081
AgentPay connects to PayPal's Orders v2 REST API.

13
00:01:21,081 --> 00:01:27,775
We open the checkout modal, verify our spending limit guardrail, and authorize the order via PayPal Sandbox.

14
00:01:29,895 --> 00:01:31,607
Payment captured!

15
00:01:31,557 --> 00:01:39,147
AgentPay issues an authenticated digital receipt with PayPal Order ID, Capture ID, and an AI savings report.

16
00:01:39,147 --> 00:01:43,034
AgentPay is open source under MIT and ready for judging.

17
00:01:43,034 --> 00:01:44,397
Thank you!

